    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Khorne Lord of Skulls",
    "summary": "This model moves freely during each Advance, Fall Back or **Normal move** it makes:\n\n- It can pass through models (except **TITANIC** models) and **terrain feature** sections no more than 4\" tall.\n- While doing so, it may come within **Engagement Range** of an enemy model, but may not end the move there.\n- It can also pass through terrain feature sections over 4\" tall. If it does, roll 1 D6 after the move: a 1 leaves this model **Battle-shocked**.",
